andomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nMr. Lin runs an antique shop, famous for its rare antiques. One day, a customer named Ms. Li enters the shop, showing great interest in a valuable jade artifact. Mr. Lin knows that this jade artifact is actually a modern product he buys on an overseas trip a few years ago, but he tells Ms. Li that it is a precious relic from the Ming Dynasty, with a history of hundreds of years. Ms. Li listens and is very happy, she does not hesitate to pay a high price for the jade artifact. Afterwards, Mr. Lin mentions to other customers that this jade artifact is indeed the star product in his shop, not only because of its historical value, but also because it attracts the attention of many collectors.\n\n[Question]\nDoes Mr. Lin tell the truth?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Yes\nB. No","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":6.263221814843732E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52bbdc2ddb05a7fe311cf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452413476,"createTime":"2026-11-12 11:00:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9af7676d67c64520ab7e0a0dc3cf3bc2"}